WEBVTT

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:04.770
<i>Wealth, fame, power...</i>

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:06.670
<i>Gold Roger,
the King of the Pirates,</i>

00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:08.970
<i>attained everything
this world has to offer.</i>

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:12.840
<i>The words he uttered just before
his death drove people to the seas.</i>

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:16.680
<i>My treasure? If you want it,
you can have it!</i>

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>Find it! I left everything
this world has to offer there!</i>

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:27.590
<i>And so men head for the Grand Line
in pursuit of their dreams!</i>

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:31.490
<i>The world has truly entered
a Great Pirate Era!</i>

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:36.860
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:42.770
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:44.100
<i>ONE PIECE!</i>

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:54.620
<i>Compasses only cause delays</i>

00:00:54.620 --> 00:01:00.350
<i>Delirious with fever,
I take the helm</i>

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:10.350
<i>If the dusty treasure map has
been verified, it's not a legend!</i>

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:18.170
<i>When it comes to personal storms,</i>

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:23.480
<i>simply ride aboard
someone else's biorhythm</i>

00:01:23.480 --> 00:01:27.150
<i>and pretend it isn't there!</i>

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:32.650
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:38.360
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:44.600
<i>A coin in my pocket,
and do you wanna be my friend?</i>

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:49.970
<i>We are, We are on the cruise!</i>

00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:51.040
<i>We are!</i>

00:02:00.950 --> 00:02:02.520
Another big haul today!

00:02:02.520 --> 00:02:05.350
<i>Buggy-sama won't be mad at us,
now that we got all this!</i>

00:02:05.350 --> 00:02:06.850
Huh?

00:02:06.850 --> 00:02:08.850
Hey, check it out...

00:02:13.630 --> 00:02:15.620
What's with that boat?

00:02:28.740 --> 00:02:31.110
I-it's a girl!

00:02:31.110 --> 00:02:33.100
Hey! What's wrong with you?

00:02:34.950 --> 00:02:38.620
Oh! Am I dreaming?

00:02:38.620 --> 00:02:41.620
Running into someone
on this wide open sea...

00:02:41.620 --> 00:02:44.460
I- I don't know who you are,
but... water...

00:02:44.460 --> 00:02:47.130
Might I ask for a cup of water?

00:02:47.130 --> 00:02:49.900
I can give you all
the money you'd like.

00:02:49.900 --> 00:02:52.000
Please, help me!

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:54.470
No problem!
We'll help you!

00:02:54.470 --> 00:02:57.640
But not until we see what
treasure ya got!

00:02:57.640 --> 00:02:59.300
Don't mind us!

00:03:03.210 --> 00:03:06.040
I can't get it open...
Does it go like this?

00:03:11.690 --> 00:03:15.690
You can keep my entire boat,
if you'd like!

00:03:15.690 --> 00:03:17.430
Our boat!

00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:19.420
You tricked us!

00:03:21.900 --> 00:03:25.800
A cold front accompanied by low
clouds spotted in the southern sky!

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:28.970
Intense winds and squalls
expected very soon!

00:03:28.970 --> 00:03:31.630
All small boats take
caution not to capsize!

00:03:43.620 --> 00:03:45.990
Bingo!

00:03:45.990 --> 00:03:50.060
See ya! I'll just take
your treasure now!

00:03:50.060 --> 00:03:51.930
Wait! You bitch-!

00:03:51.930 --> 00:03:54.360
We'll get you for this-!

00:03:54.360 --> 00:04:03.360
"Luffy's Past!
Enter Red-Haired Shanks"

00:04:05.070 --> 00:04:08.110
I'm starving...

00:04:08.110 --> 00:04:10.850
When the hell're
we gonna reach land?

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:15.250
Who knows. We're just going with
the wind and waves, after all...

00:04:15.250 --> 00:04:16.880
I wonder if we'll reach land...

00:04:16.880 --> 00:04:19.480
Nah, I'm sure we will, sometime.

00:04:20.590 --> 00:04:23.790
Isn't it kind of weird that someone
tryin' to be King of the Pirates...

00:04:23.790 --> 00:04:25.890
...doesn't even have
any navigational skills?!

00:04:25.890 --> 00:04:28.900
It's not weird.
I just drifted around.

00:04:28.900 --> 00:04:33.070
<i>But aren't you a bounty hunter
who wandered the high seas?</i>

00:04:33.070 --> 00:04:36.730
I have no memory of ever even
calling myself a bounty hunter.

00:04:38.910 --> 00:04:41.940
I set onto the sea in search
of a certain man...

00:04:41.940 --> 00:04:44.910
...but then couldn't get
back to my village.

00:04:44.910 --> 00:04:48.680
I had no choice, so I just went
after pirate ships to earn a living.

00:04:48.680 --> 00:04:50.280
Oh. So you're just lost.

00:04:50.280 --> 00:04:52.450
Don't put it like that!

00:05:00.590 --> 00:05:02.090
Shanks!

00:05:07.230 --> 00:05:09.900
This straw hat is dear to me-

00:05:09.900 --> 00:05:12.900
it's been with me
through many a fight.

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:18.610
Luffy. I can't give
this even to you.

00:05:48.480 --> 00:05:51.710
Then take me on your
next voyage, Shanks!

00:05:51.710 --> 00:05:54.050
I wanna be a pirate too!

00:05:55.450 --> 00:05:58.050
As if you could
ever be a pirate!

00:05:58.050 --> 00:05:59.710
Why not?!

00:06:01.020 --> 00:06:01.960
Luffy.

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:05.960
Just bein' a good swimmer doesn't
mean you'd make a good pirate.

00:06:05.960 --> 00:06:09.700
I'm good at fighting too!
My punches are like pistols!

00:06:09.700 --> 00:06:10.970
Oh, really?

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:12.800
What's that mean?!

00:06:12.800 --> 00:06:15.440
He means you're too much
of a kid, Luffy!

00:06:15.440 --> 00:06:17.940
Seriously, you're as old
as my own kid!

00:06:17.940 --> 00:06:20.270
I'm not a kid!
I'm a grownup!

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:22.110
Now, now.
Don't get so mad.

00:06:22.110 --> 00:06:23.680
Here! Have some juice!

00:06:23.680 --> 00:06:25.510
Wow! Thanks!

00:06:26.980 --> 00:06:30.850
<i>--See, you are a kid! Ha!
--That wasn't fair, Shanks!</i>

00:06:32.820 --> 00:06:34.590
Don't laugh!

00:06:34.590 --> 00:06:37.250
Stupid cheapskate Shanks!

00:06:47.100 --> 00:06:48.570
Pardon us.

00:06:54.310 --> 00:06:57.340
<i>Oh... So these are "pirates".</i>

00:06:57.340 --> 00:06:59.680
Look pretty damn dumb.

00:07:04.220 --> 00:07:05.710
Welcome...

00:07:08.020 --> 00:07:10.020
We're mountain bandits.

00:07:10.020 --> 00:07:13.060
But we ain't here
to tear up the place.

00:07:13.060 --> 00:07:17.060
Sell us some booze.
10 barrels oughta do.

00:07:17.060 --> 00:07:20.870
I'm sorry.
I just ran out of alcohol.

00:07:20.870 --> 00:07:22.400
That's odd.

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:26.270
These pirates seem to be drinking
something... What is it, water?

00:07:26.270 --> 00:07:29.780
No, what they're drinking
is the last of it.

00:07:29.780 --> 00:07:34.980
My apologies. Looks like we
drank the whole place dry.

00:07:34.980 --> 00:07:36.450
Sorry!

00:07:36.450 --> 00:07:40.110
You can have this, if you'd like.
It hasn't been opened yet.

00:07:47.390 --> 00:07:51.230
There's an 8 million Berry
bounty on my head, you know.

00:07:51.230 --> 00:07:56.000
One bottle ain't even enough for
a bedtime drink! Don't insult me!

00:07:58.910 --> 00:08:01.610
Now the floor's all wet.

00:08:01.610 --> 00:08:04.910
<i>Sorry about that, Makino-san.
Do you have a rag?</i>

00:08:04.910 --> 00:08:07.250
Oh, I'll do that!

00:08:13.450 --> 00:08:15.520
Seems you like to clean.

00:08:15.520 --> 00:08:19.530
<i>Then maybe you'll find
this more fulfilling.</i>

00:08:19.530 --> 00:08:22.960
Not worth our time if they're
out of booze. Let's go!

00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:27.760
Later, wimps!

00:08:38.310 --> 00:08:40.710
Are you all right, Captain?
Are you hurt?!

00:08:40.710 --> 00:08:43.210
Oh, I'm fine.
No problem at all.

00:08:47.820 --> 00:08:51.660
--He got you good, boss!
--Talk about lame!

00:08:54.600 --> 00:08:56.530
Why are you laughing?!

00:08:56.530 --> 00:08:58.370
That was so uncool!

00:08:58.370 --> 00:09:00.730
Why didn't you fight them?!

00:09:00.730 --> 00:09:03.170
No matter how many there are
or how strong they seem,

00:09:03.170 --> 00:09:05.940
<i>you're not men -or pirates -</i>

00:09:05.940 --> 00:09:09.140
if you laugh after
something like that!

00:09:09.140 --> 00:09:11.880
I can understand
how you feel,

00:09:11.880 --> 00:09:13.880
but he only spilled
some booze on me.

00:09:13.880 --> 00:09:15.950
It's nothing worth
getting mad over.

00:09:15.950 --> 00:09:17.610
Whatever!

00:09:25.430 --> 00:09:27.950
--Eating out of frustration, Luffy?
--Shut up!

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:31.990
Wait, what're you eating?!

00:09:33.400 --> 00:09:36.900
That box! Did you eat what
was in that box?!

00:09:36.900 --> 00:09:39.070
Y-yeah...

00:09:39.070 --> 00:09:41.640
Spit it out! Right now!
Every last bite!

00:09:41.640 --> 00:09:44.040
W-what're you doing, Shanks?!

00:09:53.850 --> 00:09:55.890
What... was that?

00:09:55.890 --> 00:09:58.590
What you ate was
the Gum-Gum Fruit!

00:09:58.590 --> 00:10:00.590
The Gum-Gum Fruit is known
as a Devil Fruit!

00:10:00.590 --> 00:10:02.460
Eating it turns your
body to rubber,

00:10:02.460 --> 00:10:06.270
and makes you lose the ability to
swim for the rest of your life!

00:10:06.270 --> 00:10:08.800
Eh?! No way!

00:10:08.800 --> 00:10:10.790
You dumbass!

00:10:28.460 --> 00:10:31.790
People were drinkin'
and havin' a nice time.

00:10:31.790 --> 00:10:34.290
What's the idea, boy?

00:10:34.290 --> 00:10:35.630
Dammit! Apologize!

00:10:35.630 --> 00:10:37.960
How dare you make fun of
Shanks and his crew!

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:43.140
Did I say something
to offend you?

00:10:43.140 --> 00:10:44.830
You did! Now apologize!

00:10:45.440 --> 00:10:46.770
Mayor!

00:10:51.650 --> 00:10:54.150
You see the looks
on those pirates' faces?!

00:10:54.150 --> 00:10:57.050
He got covered in booze
but didn't say a word!

00:10:57.050 --> 00:10:59.250
Talk about pathetic!

00:10:59.250 --> 00:11:01.760
Pirates are just
a bunch of wimps.

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:03.220
They're nothing
but talk.

00:11:03.220 --> 00:11:06.090
Stop it!

00:11:06.090 --> 00:11:08.330
Stop making fun of Shanks
and the others!

00:11:08.330 --> 00:11:09.660
<i>They are not wimps!</i>

00:11:09.660 --> 00:11:11.330
Stop, Luffy!

00:11:13.330 --> 00:11:16.340
Stop making fun of Shanks and the others!
You stupid bandits!

00:11:20.540 --> 00:11:23.780
You oughta watch
your mouth, boy.

00:11:23.780 --> 00:11:28.550
No one who's ever made me
mad has lived to tell the tale.

00:11:28.550 --> 00:11:30.250
Wait!

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:33.020
Let the boy go! Please!

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:37.260
I don't know what
Luffy has done,

00:11:37.260 --> 00:11:39.130
nor do I intend
to fight with you!

00:11:39.130 --> 00:11:41.360
If you're not offended,
I'll even pay you!

00:11:41.360 --> 00:11:44.500
Just, please!
Spare the boy's life!

00:11:44.500 --> 00:11:46.270
Mayor!

00:11:46.270 --> 00:11:50.300
Leave it to senior citizens
to know how the world works.

00:11:50.300 --> 00:11:52.670
But no, it's too late
for him now.

00:11:52.670 --> 00:11:56.610
After all, he's made me angry...

00:11:56.610 --> 00:11:59.210
<i>You're the bad guys!
You mountain apes!</i>

00:12:01.050 --> 00:12:03.050
You're a lost cause, kid.

00:12:03.050 --> 00:12:05.090
You can regret all this
in the next life!

00:12:05.090 --> 00:12:08.490
--Luffy!
--Please! Let him go!

00:12:08.490 --> 00:12:11.520
<i>I was wondering why
the bar was empty...</i>

00:12:12.530 --> 00:12:15.000
...looks like it's those
mountain bandits from before.

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:16.660
Captain!

00:12:21.100 --> 00:12:22.760
Shanks!

00:12:44.320 --> 00:12:47.560
So you pirates
are still here, huh?

00:12:47.560 --> 00:12:50.060
Have you been scrubbing the
village clean this whole time?

00:12:50.060 --> 00:12:51.330
Luffy!

00:12:51.330 --> 00:12:54.370
I thought your punches were
as strong as pistols?

00:12:54.370 --> 00:12:56.170
S-shut up!

00:12:56.170 --> 00:13:00.310
I dunno why you're here, but you'd
best leave before you get hurt.

00:13:00.310 --> 00:13:04.840
Any closer and he'll shoot
your head off, wimp.

00:13:05.910 --> 00:13:08.480
He said no closer!

00:13:08.480 --> 00:13:10.470
Don't make me blow
your head off!

00:13:16.860 --> 00:13:18.930
Put your life on the line.

00:13:18.930 --> 00:13:20.630
Huh?!

00:13:20.630 --> 00:13:23.900
Now that you've drawn your pistol,
put your life on the line.

00:13:23.900 --> 00:13:26.130
What the hell're
you talkin' about?

00:13:26.130 --> 00:13:29.300
I'm saying those aren't
for threatening people.

00:13:43.120 --> 00:13:46.690
--N-now you've done it!
--These bastards fight dirty!

00:13:46.690 --> 00:13:49.420
--Dirty?
--Cut the crap.

00:13:49.420 --> 00:13:52.330
What, do you think you're
dealing with saints or something?

00:13:52.330 --> 00:13:54.960
You're looking at pirates!

00:13:54.960 --> 00:13:58.270
Shut up! You got nothin' to do
with this in the first place!

00:13:58.270 --> 00:13:59.830
Listen, bandits.

00:13:59.830 --> 00:14:04.300
Whether I'm splattered with
alcohol or food or even spit on,

00:14:04.300 --> 00:14:06.940
most of the time I'd just
laugh and forget about it.

00:14:06.940 --> 00:14:08.210
But!

00:14:08.210 --> 00:14:09.940
No matter what the reason,

00:14:09.940 --> 00:14:13.380
anyone who hurts
my friends has to pay!

00:14:13.380 --> 00:14:14.870
Shanks...

00:14:16.780 --> 00:14:18.350
Has to pay, huh?!

00:14:18.350 --> 00:14:21.850
Lousy pirates!
Kill 'em, men!

00:14:23.720 --> 00:14:26.190
I'll handle this.
Should be easy enough.

00:14:36.240 --> 00:14:38.540
Don't get cocky, bandit.

00:14:38.540 --> 00:14:42.870
If you wanna fight us, then go
drag a warship here or somethin'.

00:14:43.910 --> 00:14:45.750
So strong!

00:14:45.750 --> 00:14:50.220
<i>H-hold on!
The kid attacked us!</i>

00:14:50.220 --> 00:14:52.890
<i>You are a wanted man.</i>

00:14:52.890 --> 00:14:55.120
Damn it!

00:14:55.120 --> 00:14:56.610
A smokescreen!

00:14:59.630 --> 00:15:01.560
Luffy!

00:15:01.560 --> 00:15:04.630
Crap! I let my guard down!
Luffy's gone!

00:15:04.630 --> 00:15:06.200
What do we do, guys?!

00:15:06.200 --> 00:15:08.640
Quit freakin'
the hell out, boss!

00:15:08.640 --> 00:15:11.470
It won't take us long
to find him!

00:15:11.470 --> 00:15:14.460
I can't believe this guy...

00:15:16.580 --> 00:15:18.380
I made a clean getaway!

00:15:18.380 --> 00:15:21.310
They'll never expect a mountain
bandit to escape onto the sea!

00:15:21.310 --> 00:15:23.820
Dammit! Let me go,
you stupid ape!

00:15:23.820 --> 00:15:26.390
I hope you die!

00:15:26.390 --> 00:15:29.390
<i>You wish! You're the one
who's gonna die!</i>

00:15:29.390 --> 00:15:32.190
After all, you've made me mad!

00:15:32.190 --> 00:15:33.520
So long!

00:15:35.300 --> 00:15:36.600
<i>Dammit! Dammit!</i>

00:15:36.600 --> 00:15:38.000
<i>Those guys are scum,</i>

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:40.990
<i>but I couldn't even
hit them once! Dammit!</i>

00:15:45.940 --> 00:15:49.500
Sorry! I got no use
for you anymore!

00:15:58.120 --> 00:16:00.450
W-what the hell?!

00:16:07.960 --> 00:16:09.620
Help!

00:16:26.280 --> 00:16:27.940
Shanks!

00:16:35.720 --> 00:16:37.050
Get lost!

00:16:56.140 --> 00:16:58.380
I'm in your debt,
Luffy...

00:16:58.380 --> 00:17:00.780
<i>Makino-san told
me everything.</i>

00:17:00.780 --> 00:17:03.270
You fought for us.

00:17:06.550 --> 00:17:10.090
Hey, don't cry!
You're a man!

00:17:10.090 --> 00:17:12.960
But... Shanks!

00:17:12.960 --> 00:17:16.360
Your arm!

00:17:16.360 --> 00:17:19.830
It's only an arm.
It's no big deal.

00:17:19.830 --> 00:17:21.500
I'm just glad
you're alright...

00:17:42.560 --> 00:17:43.990
You're leaving, then?

00:17:43.990 --> 00:17:48.130
Yeah. It was a long stay,
but now we part ways.

00:17:48.130 --> 00:17:49.660
Bet you'll miss me, huh?

00:17:49.660 --> 00:17:54.300
Well, yeah, but I won't
ask you to take me anymore.

00:17:54.300 --> 00:17:57.670
I've decided to become
a pirate on my own now!

00:17:59.240 --> 00:18:01.580
I wasn't gonna take you anyway!

00:18:01.580 --> 00:18:05.050
You'll never be a pirate!

00:18:05.050 --> 00:18:06.510
I will too!

00:18:06.510 --> 00:18:10.150
Someday, I'm gonna gather
a crew every good as yours,

00:18:10.150 --> 00:18:12.890
and I'm gonna find the greatest
treasure in the world,

00:18:12.890 --> 00:18:16.220
and I'm gonna be King
of the Pirates! I'll show you!

00:18:17.790 --> 00:18:19.780
You're gonna surpass us, huh?

00:18:22.860 --> 00:18:24.190
In that case...

00:18:26.400 --> 00:18:28.900
...I'll leave this hat with you.

00:18:28.900 --> 00:18:31.810
It's dear to me.

00:18:31.810 --> 00:18:33.800
Take good care of it!

00:18:53.260 --> 00:18:56.920
<i>Come bring it back
to me someday!</i>

00:18:57.930 --> 00:19:01.270
<i>Once you've become
a great pirate!</i>

00:19:01.270 --> 00:19:04.260
<i>That's our promise, Luffy!</i>

00:19:13.610 --> 00:19:14.610
Hey.

00:19:14.610 --> 00:19:17.120
You're gonna drop it again
if you space out.

00:19:17.120 --> 00:19:18.520
Isn't it important?

00:19:18.520 --> 00:19:20.790
Yeah.

00:19:20.790 --> 00:19:22.690
Thank you, Zoro!

00:19:22.690 --> 00:19:25.560
Man, I'm hungry...

00:19:31.970 --> 00:19:33.630
A bird...

00:19:36.140 --> 00:19:38.040
Let's eat it!

00:19:38.040 --> 00:19:39.670
Huh? How?

00:19:39.670 --> 00:19:41.840
Leave it to me!

00:19:41.840 --> 00:19:43.980
Gum-Gum...

00:19:43.980 --> 00:19:46.750
...Rocket!

00:19:46.750 --> 00:19:48.740
I see...

00:19:56.660 --> 00:19:58.090
Help!

00:19:58.090 --> 00:20:00.720
Moron! What the hell're
you doing?!

00:20:05.970 --> 00:20:10.570
Hey! Stop! You there! Stop!

00:20:10.570 --> 00:20:13.010
Shipwrecked people,
at a time like this?!

00:20:13.010 --> 00:20:16.010
I can't stop!
Jump in on your own!

00:20:16.010 --> 00:20:17.670
What?!

00:20:20.910 --> 00:20:22.180
I'm impressed you got on!

00:20:22.180 --> 00:20:24.020
Are you trying to run us over?!

00:20:24.020 --> 00:20:26.120
Hey! Stop the boat!

00:20:26.120 --> 00:20:30.090
<i>We're members of Buggy
the Clown-sama's crew!</i>

00:20:30.090 --> 00:20:31.930
This boat is ours now!

00:20:31.930 --> 00:20:33.860
Huh?!

00:20:35.860 --> 00:20:39.970
<i>We had no idea you were the
famous Pirate Hunter Zoro-san!</i>

00:20:39.970 --> 00:20:42.300
--Forgive our rudeness!
--Forgive our rudeness!

00:20:42.300 --> 00:20:45.440
Thanks to you guys,
I lost sight of my friend.

00:20:45.440 --> 00:20:46.910
Just keep padding
straight ahead!

00:20:46.910 --> 00:20:48.110
--Yessir!
--Yessir!

00:20:48.110 --> 00:20:52.440
Knowing Luffy, he'll manage
something once he spots land.

00:20:54.950 --> 00:20:58.790
But what now, Bro?

00:20:58.790 --> 00:20:59.990
Good question...

00:20:59.990 --> 00:21:05.290
<i>If Captain Buggy finds out a girl
stole our boat and treasure...</i>

00:21:05.290 --> 00:21:06.830
Y-yeah...

00:21:06.830 --> 00:21:08.900
Who's this Buggy guy?

00:21:08.900 --> 00:21:11.230
You've never heard
of Buggy the Clown?!

00:21:11.230 --> 00:21:13.170
Nope.

00:21:13.170 --> 00:21:15.940
He's the head
of our pirate ship!

00:21:15.940 --> 00:21:19.570
He's eaten one
of the Devil Fruits,

00:21:19.570 --> 00:21:22.200
and is just an all-around
terrifying person...

00:21:40.330 --> 00:21:42.660
Yes! I finally got it!

00:21:44.300 --> 00:21:47.430
--Get back here, you!
--You wench! Give the map back!

00:21:47.430 --> 00:21:51.470
We just stole that
chart of the Grand Line!

00:21:51.470 --> 00:21:54.810
Dammit! If we don't get it back,
we're dead meat, too!

00:21:54.810 --> 00:21:57.470
I don't wanna be killed by one
of the captain's cannonballs!

00:22:02.050 --> 00:22:06.420
Captain Buggy! I see something
in the sky above the port!

00:22:06.420 --> 00:22:08.080
Shoot it down!

00:22:14.330 --> 00:22:15.990
W-what the-?

00:22:25.770 --> 00:22:27.440
W-what?!

00:22:27.440 --> 00:22:29.010
What the-?!

00:22:29.010 --> 00:22:31.110
A person fell from the sky!

00:22:31.110 --> 00:22:35.010
Dammit! What are cannonballs
flying at me for?!

00:22:40.020 --> 00:22:41.790
But now I'm safe!

00:22:41.790 --> 00:22:45.120
That was a pretty neat
experience I had!

00:22:56.140 --> 00:23:06.130
<i>When I was little, I had
a vision of a treasure map</i>

00:23:10.280 --> 00:23:17.220
<i>and I always searched
for that miraculous place</i>

00:23:17.220 --> 00:23:24.390
<i>before someone else could
beat me to it</i>

00:23:26.930 --> 00:23:36.930
<i>If the world is going to change</i>

00:23:38.410 --> 00:23:45.420
<i>before I can even attain my dream</i>

00:23:45.420 --> 00:23:52.490
<i>then take me to the time
when I knew nothing</i>

00:23:52.490 --> 00:24:02.490
<i>so that my memories won't fade</i>
